<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH LEAGUE AND CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH LEAGUE AND CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of English soccer matches</p>
<p>on Wednesday:</p>
<p>F.A. Cup fifth round</p>
<p> Derby	 3   Coventry	 2  </p>
<p>(Derby home to Middlesbrough in quarter-finals)</p>
<p>Fifth round replay</p>
<p> Chelsea     1   Leicester     0 - after extra time   </p>
<p>(Chelsea away to Portsmouth)</p>
<p>League Cup semifinal, first leg</p>
<p> Stockport   0    Middlesbrough 2    </p>
<p>Premier league</p>
<p> Southampton 0   Wimbledon	0   </p>
<p>Division one</p>
<p> Swindon     3   Birmingham     1</p>
</text>
